name: CA1-ProS Glut_1 hippocampal CA1-3 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A hippocampal CA1-3 neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lefty1 (Mmus), Fibcd1 (Mmus), Pcp4l1 (Mmus). Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in supertype:0069 CA1-ProS Glut_1 (CS20230722_SUPT_0069)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, CA1-ProS Glut_1 does not have cells in prosubiculum (ProS). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0069 CA1-ProS Glut_1" EXACT []
synonym: "Lefty1 (Mmus), Fibcd1 (Mmus), Pcp4l1 (Mmus) expressing hippocampal CA1-3 neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
