[Term]
id: PCL:0111012
name: PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_1 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Isl1 (Mmus), Pgr15l (Mmus), Sox2ot (Mmus), Piezo2 (Mmus), Prox1 (Mmus). Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in supertype:0442 PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_SUPT_0442)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_1 does not have cells in subparaventricular zone (SBPV). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0442 PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_1" EXACT []
synonym: "Isl1 (Mmus), Pgr15l (Mmus), Sox2ot (Mmus), Piezo2 (Mmus), Prox1 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
