def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Foxb1 (Mmus), Emx2 (Mmus), Cck (Mmus), Sfta3-ps (Mmus). Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in supertype:0620 PMd-LHA Foxb1 Glut_2 (CS20230722_SUPT_0620)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, PMd-LHA Foxb1 Glut_2 does not have cells in dorsal premammillary nucleus (PMd). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
