def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igkc (Mmus), Chrdl1 (Mmus), Tcf7l2 (Mmus). Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in supertype:0653 CM-IAD-CL-PCN Sema5b Glut_5 (CS20230722_SUPT_0653)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, CM-IAD-CL-PCN Sema5b Glut_5 does not have cells in interanterodorsal nucleus of the thalamus (IAD), central lateral nucleus of the thalamus (CL), paracentral nucleus (PCN). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
