def: "A intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Prss22 (Mmus), Il1rapl2 (Mmus), Fgf11 (Mmus), Met (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L5/6 IT TPE-ENT Glut_2 cells by expression of Cxcl12, Fezf2, Scml4. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Isocortex, in or close to the regions: Ectorhinal area/Layer 5, Temporal association areas, layer 5, Visceral area, layer 5, Postrhinal area, layer 5, Prelimbic area, layer 5. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0026 L5/6 IT TPE-ENT Glut_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_0026)." []
