def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Naa11 (Mmus), Satb2 (Mmus), Ankrd63 (Mmus), Rorb (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT CTX Glut_3 cells by expression of Naa11, Rorb. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Isocortex, in or close to the regions: Primary auditory area, layer 2/3, Ectorhinal area/Layer 2/3, Visceral area, layer 2/3, Ventral auditory area, layer 2/3, Postrhinal area, layer 2/3, Temporal association areas, layer 2/3. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0113 L2/3 IT CTX Glut_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_0113)." []
