def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Smoc2 (Mmus), Met (Mmus), Lypd1 (Mmus), Bmpr1b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT CTX Glut_3 cells by expression of Bmpr1b, Met, Dio3, Wnt7b. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Isocortex, in or close to the regions: Ectorhinal area/Layer 2/3, Supplemental somatosensory area, layer 2/3, Gustatory areas, layer 2/3, Gustatory areas, layer 1, Agranular insular area, posterior part, layer 2/3, Visceral area, layer 2/3, Perirhinal area, layer 2/3. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0114 L2/3 IT CTX Glut_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_0114)." []
