def: "A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ccn2 (Mmus), Calca (Mmus), Oxtr (Mmus), Cdh18 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L6b EPd Glut_2 cells by expression of Npr3. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Isocortex, Cortical subplate, in or close to the regions: Endopiriform nucleus, dorsal part, Visceral area, layer 6b, Claustrum, external capsule, Agranular insular area, posterior part, layer 6a, amygdalar capsule. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0405 L6b EPd Glut_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_0405)." []
