def: "A sncg GABAergic cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Calcb (Mmus), Myh8 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sncg Gaba_5 cells by expression of Stc1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hippocampal region, Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region, in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum oriens, cingulum bundle, Prosubiculum, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 6a, Subiculum, Anterior cingulate area, ventral part, 6a. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0679 Sncg Gaba_5 (CS20230722_CLUS_0679)." []
