id: PCL:0113068
name: RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1 Klhl1 caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gdf6 (Mmus), Grpr (Mmus), Vgll3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1 cells by expression of Klhl1, Gm31218. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hippocampal region, in or close to the regions: Field CA3, stratum oriens, Field CA1, stratum lacunosum-moleculare, Field CA1, stratum radiatum, Field CA3, pyramidal layer, Field CA3, stratum radiatum. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0688 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_0688)." []
comment: Warning: This type RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1 Klhl1 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for retrohippocampal region (RHP), cortical amygdalar area (COA). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0688 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1" EXACT []
synonym: "Gdf6 (Mmus), Grpr (Mmus), Vgll3 (Mmus) expressing caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
