def: "A caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gdf6 (Mmus), Npas1 (Mmus), Cbln2 (Mmus), Mpped1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1 cells by expression of D430036J16Rik, Cbln2, Mpped1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hippocampal region, Retrohippocampal region, in or close to the regions: Field CA3, stratum oriens, Posterior amygdalar nucleus, Field CA1, stratum lacunosum-moleculare, Field CA1, stratum radiatum, Field CA3, stratum lucidum, Field CA3, pyramidal layer, Field CA3, stratum radiatum, Dentate gyrus, molecular layer, Field CA3, stratum lacunosum-moleculare. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0689 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_0689)." []
