[Term]
id: PCL:0113076
name: RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 Plxnd1 caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col14a1 (Mmus), Prom1 (Mmus), Frem2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 cells by expression of Plxnd1, Gda. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hippocampal region, Isocortex, Olfactory areas, Retrohippocampal region, in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum lacunosum-moleculare, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 1, Field CA1, stratum radiatum, Piriform area, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 2. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0696 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_0696)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 Plxnd1 does not have cells in cortical amygdalar area (COA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0696 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3" EXACT []
synonym: "Col14a1 (Mmus), Prom1 (Mmus), Frem2 (Mmus) expressing caudal ganglionic eminence derived cortical interneuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
