id: PCL:0113086
name: Lamp5 Gaba_1 Sln lamp5 GABAergic cortical interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A lamp5 GABAergic cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sln (Mmus), Lamp5 (Mmus), Rxfp1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Sln, Has2os, Cxcl14. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region, in or close to the regions: Supplemental somatosensory area, layer 1. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0706 Lamp5 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_0706)." []
