def: "A sst chodl GABAergic cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Adgrg6 (Mmus), Chodl (Mmus), Bace2 (Mmus), Hhip (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sst Chodl Gaba_2 cells by expression of Bmp3, Hhip, Chodl. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Olfactory areas, Striatum dorsal region, Isocortex, Cortical subplate, Striatum ventral region, in or close to the regions: Striatum, Endopiriform nucleus, ventral part, Caudoputamen, Olfactory areas, Nucleus accumbens, Olfactory tubercle. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0850 Sst Chodl Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_0850)." []
