id: PCL:0113242
name: Sst Chodl Gaba_6 sst chodl GABAergic cortical interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A sst chodl GABAergic cortical interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cox6a2 (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus), Drd1 (Mmus), Gpr139 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sst Chodl Gaba cells by expression of Pvalb. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Striatum, Substantia innominata, Pallidum, Anterior amygdalar area, Magnocellular nucleus, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0862 Sst Chodl Gaba_6 (CS20230722_SUPT_0243, CS20230722_CLUS_0862)." []
