id: PCL:0113248
name: NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_1 Pgr15l medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cyp26a1 (Mmus), Pgr15l (Mmus), Zfp536 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Pgr15l, Zfp536. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Magnocellular nucleus, Substantia innominata, Diagonal band nucleus, Pallidum. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0868 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_0868)." []
