id: PCL:0113256
name: NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_2 D7Ertd443e medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lhx8 (Mmus), Atp8b1 (Mmus), D7Ertd443e (Mmus), Kcng1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_2 cells by expression of D7Ertd443e, Tshr, Casz1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Olfactory areas, Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Magnocellular nucleus, Substantia innominata, Striatum. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0876 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_0876)." []
