def: "A medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lhx8 (Mmus), Ngf (Mmus), Vgll3 (Mmus), Slc5a7 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba cells by expression of D7Ertd443e, Slc5a7. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Striatum ventral region, Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Substantia innominata, Nucleus accumbens, Olfactory tubercle. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:0915 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_11 (CS20230722_SUPT_0254, CS20230722_CLUS_0915)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_11 does not have cells in diagonal band nucleus (NDB), magnocellular nucleus (MA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0254 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_11" EXACT []
synonym: "0915 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_11" EXACT []
synonym: "Lhx8 (Mmus), Ngf (Mmus), Vgll3 (Mmus), Slc5a7 (Mmus) expressing medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
