name: IA Mgp Gaba_3 Tshr lateral ganglionic eminence derived neuron (Mmus)
def: "A lateral ganglionic eminence derived neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Fmod (Mmus), Npsr1 (Mmus), Ngf (Mmus). It is distinguished from other IA Mgp Gaba_3 cells by expression of Tshr, Npsr1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate, in or close to the regions: Endopiriform nucleus, ventral part, Olfactory areas, Piriform area, external capsule, Cortical subplate, Basolateral amygdalar nucleus, anterior part, anterior commissure, temporal limb. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1021 IA Mgp Gaba_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_1021)." []
