def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Prdm12 (Mmus), Mas1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NDB-SI-ant Prdm12 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Mypn. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate, in or close to the regions: Anterior olfactory nucleus, Olfactory areas, Endopiriform nucleus, dorsal part, Piriform area. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1036 NDB-SI-ant Prdm12 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_1036)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, NDB-SI-ant Prdm12 Gaba_1 Mypn does not have cells in diagonal band nucleus (NDB). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1036 NDB-SI-ant Prdm12 Gaba_1" EXACT []
synonym: "Prdm12 (Mmus), Mas1 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
