def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Nr2e1 (Mmus), Npsr1 (Mmus), Zbbx (Mmus), Arhgef26 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-BST Sox6 Gaba_5 cells by expression of Sst, Gm2516. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Olfactory areas, Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Anterior amygdalar area, Medial amygdalar nucleus, Cortical amygdalar area, anterior part. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1218 MEA-BST Sox6 Gaba_5 (CS20230722_CLUS_1218)." []
