def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col6a5 (Mmus), Frem3 (Mmus), Tll1 (Mmus), Rasd2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-BST Lhx6 Nr2e1 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Plpp4, Irs4. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate, in or close to the regions: Striatum, Basomedial amygdalar nucleus, anterior part, Cortical amygdalar area, anterior part, Anterior amygdalar area, Medial amygdalar nucleus, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1273 MEA-BST Lhx6 Nr2e1 Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_1273)." []
