def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Adora2a (Mmus), Nts (Mmus), Pax6 (Mmus), Gm38505 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CEA-AAA-BST Six3 Sp9 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Rbm20, Penk. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Striatum ventral region, Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Substantia innominata, Striatum, Nucleus accumbens, Caudoputamen. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1365 CEA-AAA-BST Six3 Sp9 Gaba_4 (CS20230722_CLUS_1365)." []
