synonym: "1490 MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_2" EXACT []
synonym: "Lhx8 (Mmus), Gm29683 (Mmus), Pappa (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
