[Term]
id: PCL:0114133
name: ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 Cdc14a neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm4881 (Mmus), Prdm12 (Mmus), Pde11a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 cells by expression of Cdc14a. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, in or close to the regions: Hypothalamus, Lateral hypothalamic area, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1753 ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 (CS20230722_CLUS_1753)." []
comment: Warning: This type ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 Cdc14a does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for zona incerta (ZI). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
