def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Piezo2 (Mmus), Isl1 (Mmus), Npas1 (Mmus), Scn7a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other ZI Pax6 Gaba_8 cells by expression of Sema3e, Trhr. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, Thalamus, Pallidum, in or close to the regions: Perireunensis nucleus, Pallidum, Hypothalamus, Lateral hypothalamic area, internal capsule, Ventral posterolateral nucleus of the thalamus, Midbrain, Subthalamic nucleus, Zona incerta. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1771 ZI Pax6 Gaba_8 (CS20230722_CLUS_1771)." []
synonym: "1771 ZI Pax6 Gaba_8" EXACT []
synonym: "Piezo2 (Mmus), Isl1 (Mmus), Npas1 (Mmus), Scn7a (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
