comment: Warning: Despite its name, DMH-LHA Gsx1 Gaba_2 Gbx2 does not have cells in dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus (DMH). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1799 DMH-LHA Gsx1 Gaba_2" EXACT []
