def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igsf5 (Mmus), Nkx2-4 (Mmus), BC039966 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVHd-DMH Lhx6 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Igsf5, BC039966. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, in or close to the regions: Hypothalamus, Lateral hypothalamic area, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1836 PVHd-DMH Lhx6 Gaba_4 (CS20230722_CLUS_1836)." []
comment: Warning: This type PVHd-DMH Lhx6 Gaba_4 Igsf5 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus, descending division (PVHd), dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus (DMH). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1836 PVHd-DMH Lhx6 Gaba_4" EXACT []
