def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Six6 (Mmus), Scn11a (Mmus), Zeb2 (Mmus), Kcnj5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other TU-ARH Otp Six6 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Pou3f1, Kcnj5. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Tuberal nucleus, Perifornical nucleus, Hypothalamus, Anterior hypothalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1858 TU-ARH Otp Six6 Gaba_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_1858)." []
