name: PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_1 Col4a4 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Apoc3 (Mmus), Col4a4 (Mmus), Tacr1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Col4a4, Tacr1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, in or close to the regions: Anteroventral periventricular nucleus, brain, third ventricle, Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, preoptic part, optic chiasm, fiber tracts, optic nerve. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1875 PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_1875)." []
