id: PCL:0114316
name: DMH Hmx2 Gaba_2 Map3k19 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Apoc3 (Mmus), Eya4 (Mmus), Tac1 (Mmus), Asb4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other DMH Hmx2 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Map3k19, Apoc3, Kl. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, in or close to the regions: Hypothalamus, Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, intermediate part, Arcuate hypothalamic nucleus, Ventromedial hypothalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1936 DMH Hmx2 Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_1936)." []
