def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ngf (Mmus), Onecut1 (Mmus), Zic1 (Mmus), Sulf1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LGv-ZI Otx2 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Onecut1, Cnr1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Ventral part of the lateral geniculate complex, Reticular nucleus of the thalamus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:1977 LGv-ZI Otx2 Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_1977)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, LGv-ZI Otx2 Gaba_2 Onecut1 does not have cells in zona incerta (ZI). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1977 LGv-ZI Otx2 Gaba_2" EXACT []
synonym: "Ngf (Mmus), Onecut1 (Mmus), Zic1 (Mmus), Sulf1 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
