def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Foxb1 (Mmus), Snx31 (Mmus), Mettl11b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PMd-LHA Foxb1 Glut_2 cells by expression of Snx31, Mettl11b. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, in or close to the regions: Ventral premammillary nucleus, Hypothalamus, Lateral hypothalamic area, Dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:2531 PMd-LHA Foxb1 Glut_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_2531)." []
