def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm19303 (Mmus), Hs3st3a1 (Mmus), Ntng1 (Mmus), Prlr (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RE-Xi Nox4 Glut_2 cells by expression of Adgrf5, Zfp536. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Rhomboid nucleus, Submedial nucleus of the thalamus, Perireunensis nucleus, Nucleus of reuniens, Anteromedial nucleus, dorsal part, Thalamus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:2697 RE-Xi Nox4 Glut_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_2697)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, RE-Xi Nox4 Glut_2 Adgrf5 does not have cells in xiphoid thalamic nucleus (Xi). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "2697 RE-Xi Nox4 Glut_2" EXACT []
