def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm15934 (Mmus), Sp9 (Mmus), Scube1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_2 cells by expression of Chrdl1, Nhlh2. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Midbrain, Posterior intralaminar thalamic nucleus, Subparafascicular nucleus, parvicellular part, Midbrain reticular nucleus, Thalamus, Posterior triangular thalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:2945 SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_2945)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_2 Chrdl1 does not have cells in subparafascicular area (SPA), subparafascicular nucleus, magnocellular part (SPFm), posterior limiting nucleus of the thalamus (POL). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "2945 SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_2" EXACT []
synonym: "Gm15934 (Mmus), Sp9 (Mmus), Scube1 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
