def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gbx2 (Mmus), Moxd1 (Mmus), Cbln2 (Mmus), B130024G19Rik (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_7 cells by expression of Moxd1, Sox2, Trpc4. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Medial geniculate complex, medial part, Subparafascicular nucleus, parvicellular part, Posterior intralaminar thalamic nucleus, Thalamus, Posterior triangular thalamic nucleus, Ventral posteromedial nucleus of the thalamus, parvicellular part, Midbrain. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:2987 SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_7 (CS20230722_CLUS_2987)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_7 Sox2 does not have cells in subparafascicular area (SPA), subparafascicular nucleus, magnocellular part (SPFm), posterior limiting nucleus of the thalamus (POL). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
