name: SCiw Pitx2 Glut_1 Evx1os neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pitx2 (Mmus), Evx1os (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCiw Pitx2 Glut_1 cells by expression of Evx1os. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Midbrain, Inferior colliculus, dorsal nucleus, Cuneiform nucleus, Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate white layer. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3264 SCiw Pitx2 Glut_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_3264)." []
