def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Tfap2d (Mmus), Tcf7l1 (Mmus), Sntb1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other IC Tfap2d Maf Glut cells by expression of Col18a1, Sntb1. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum, in or close to the regions: Simple lobule, Midbrain, Inferior colliculus, external nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3315 IC Tfap2d Maf Glut_5 (CS20230722_SUPT_0774, CS20230722_CLUS_3315)." []
