name: CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1 Mab21l2 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Scgn (Mmus), Lhx9 (Mmus), Lhfp (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1 cells by expression of Mab21l2, Mob3b. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, in or close to the regions: Pedunculopontine nucleus, Midbrain, Parabrachial nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3325 CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_3325)." []
