def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Foxd2os (Mmus), C1ql4 (Mmus), Calb2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other ND-INC Foxd2 Glut cells by expression of Kcng3. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Midbrain, Subparafascicular nucleus, magnocellular part, Thalamus, Periaqueductal gray. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3384 ND-INC Foxd2 Glut_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_3384)." []
