def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Itgb6 (Mmus), Sox14 (Mmus), Col11a1 (Mmus), Mgat4c (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Nmur2, Calca. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Ventral part of the lateral geniculate complex, fiber tracts, auditory radiation, Intergeniculate leaflet of the lateral geniculate complex, Zona incerta. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3646 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_3646)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_2 Nmur2 does not have cells in subparafascicular nucleus, parvicellular part (SPFp), subparafascicular nucleus, magnocellular part (SPFm). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "3646 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_2" EXACT []
