def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Serpina3g (Mmus), Sox14 (Mmus), Drd2 (Mmus), Slc32a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Serpina3g, Drd2. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hippocampal region, Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Ventral part of the lateral geniculate complex, Intermediate geniculate nucleus, Intergeniculate leaflet of the lateral geniculate complex, Dorsal part of the lateral geniculate complex, core, Dentate gyrus, molecular layer, auditory radiation. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3653 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4 (CS20230722_CLUS_3653)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4 Serpina3g does not have cells in subparafascicular nucleus, parvicellular part (SPFp), subparafascicular nucleus, magnocellular part (SPFm). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "3653 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4" EXACT []
synonym: "Serpina3g (Mmus), Sox14 (Mmus), Drd2 (Mmus), Slc32a1 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
