def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Chrna6 (Mmus), Qrfpr (Mmus), Col19a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_5 cells by expression of Chrna6, Zeb2. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Ventral part of the lateral geniculate complex, Intergeniculate leaflet of the lateral geniculate complex, Intermediate geniculate nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3661 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_5 (CS20230722_CLUS_3661)." []
