def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Nkx2-2 (Mmus), Apbb1ip (Mmus), Zic1 (Mmus), Lgr5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_7 cells by expression of Eya1, Lgr5. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Ventral part of the lateral geniculate complex, Intergeniculate leaflet of the lateral geniculate complex. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3668 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_7 (CS20230722_CLUS_3668)." []
