name: SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 Abcc9 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc26a7 (Mmus), Abcc9 (Mmus), Crhbp (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 cells by expression of Abcc9, Slc32a1. It is dopaminergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, in or close to the regions: Interfascicular nucleus raphe, Midbrain, Central linear nucleus raphe, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3841 SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_3841)." []
