[Term]
id: PCL:0116224
name: SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 Ptprq neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ptprq (Mmus), Lmx1a (Mmus), Lncenc1 (Mmus), Igf1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 cells by expression of Ptprq, Lncenc1, Igf1. It is glutamatergic and GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Hypothalamus, Midbrain, in or close to the regions: Midbrain, Central linear nucleus raphe, Dorsal nucleus raphe, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3844 SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_3844)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 Ptprq does not have cells in substantia nigra, compact part (SNc). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme. Warning: Despite its name, SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1 Ptprq does not secrete the neurotransmitter Dopa, as assessed by expression of multiple marker genes.
synonym: "3844 SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_1" EXACT []
synonym: "Ptprq (Mmus), Lmx1a (Mmus), Lncenc1 (Mmus), Igf1 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
