def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc6a4 (Mmus), Prokr2 (Mmus), Nxph4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_1 cells by expression of Tph1, Tmem72. It is serotonergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, in or close to the regions: Midbrain, Periaqueductal gray, Dorsal nucleus raphe. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3883 MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_3883)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_1 Tph1 does not have cells in medulla (MY). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
