def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Fev (Mmus), Calca (Mmus), 9530026P05Rik (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_3 cells by expression of Calca, 9530026P05Rik. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, in or close to the regions: superior cerebellar peduncle decussation, Dorsal nucleus raphe. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:3901 MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_3901)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_3 Calca does not have cells in medulla (MY). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme. Warning: Despite its name, MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_3 Calca does not secrete the neurotransmitter Sero, as assessed by expression of multiple marker genes.
