name: PB Evx2 Glut_4 Lamp5 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Evx1os (Mmus), Esm1 (Mmus), Mc4r (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB Evx2 Glut_4 cells by expression of Lamp5, Arhgap36. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Cerebellum, Pons, in or close to the regions: ventral spinocerebellar tract, Parabrachial nucleus, Lobule III. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4051 PB Evx2 Glut_4 (CS20230722_CLUS_4051)." []
synonym: "4051 PB Evx2 Glut_4" EXACT []
