def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Tlx1 (Mmus), Calcr (Mmus), Elfn1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRNc-PARN Tlx1 Glut_1 cells by expression of Sema3d. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Medulla, Pons, in or close to the regions: Pontine reticular nucleus, caudal part, Medial vestibular nucleus, Medulla, Pons. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4139 PRNc-PARN Tlx1 Glut_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_4139)." []
