id: PCL:0116534
name: PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 Ltbp1 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Six2 (Mmus), Calca (Mmus), Itga6 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 cells by expression of Ltbp1, Irs4. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Pons, in or close to the regions: superior cerebelar peduncles, Pons, Parabrachial nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4154 PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_4154)." []
