id: PCL:0116537
name: PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 Megf10 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Iqcf3 (Mmus), Phox2b (Mmus), Gpsm3 (Mmus), Gda (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 cells by expression of Megf10, Drd2. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Pons, in or close to the regions: Supratrigeminal nucleus, Peritrigeminal zone, Pons, Parabrachial nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4157 PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_4157)." []
