def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Tlx1 (Mmus), Pirt (Mmus), Ebf2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_5 cells by expression of Crhr2. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Medulla, in or close to the regions: Medulla, Spinal nucleus of the trigeminal, interpolar part, Spinal nucleus of the trigeminal, oral part, Parvicellular reticular nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4371 PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_5 (CS20230722_CLUS_4371)." []
