def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cryba2 (Mmus), Calca (Mmus), Ebf2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 cells by expression of Krt17. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum, in or close to the regions: Ventral cochlear nucleus, Flocculus, arbor vitae. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4565 VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_4565)." []
