id: PCL:0117031
name: PRNc Otp Gly-Gaba_3 Tafa4 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm4881 (Mmus), Rbp1 (Mmus), Nxph4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRNc Otp Gly-Gaba_3 cells by expression of Tafa4, Cartpt. It is GABAergic and glycinergic. These cells are are located in the Pons, in or close to the regions: Tegmental reticular nucleus, Pons. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4651 PRNc Otp Gly-Gaba_3 (CS20230722_CLUS_4651)." []
