[Term]
id: PCL:0117100
name: NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_1 Qrfprl neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Abcc12 (Mmus), Slc17a8 (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Qrfprl. It is glutamatergic and GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Pons, in or close to the regions: Nucleus raphe pontis, Nucleus incertus, Superior central nucleus raphe, Pons. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4720 NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_4720)." []
