def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Areg (Mmus), Galr1 (Mmus), C1ql1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Galr1, C1ql1. It is glutamatergic. These cells are are located in the Pons, in or close to the regions: fourth ventricle, Nucleus incertus, Pontine central gray, Lobule II. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4727 NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_4727)." []
comment: Warning: Despite its name, NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_2 Galr1 does not have cells in nucleus raphe pontis (RPO). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme. Warning: Despite its name, NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_2 Galr1 does not secrete the neurotransmitter Gaba, as assessed by expression of multiple marker genes.
synonym: "4727 NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_2" EXACT []
