name: LDT-PCG-CS Gata3 Lhx1 Gaba_4 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc17a8 (Mmus), Pax5 (Mmus), Scube2 (Mmus), Slc32a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LDT-PCG-CS Gata3 Lhx1 Gaba cells by expression of Scube2, Pax5. It is glutamatergic and GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, Pons, in or close to the regions: Periaqueductal gray, superior cerebellar peduncle decussation, Superior central nucleus raphe, Midbrain, cerebral aqueduct, Pontine central gray, Interpeduncular nucleus, apical, Anterior tegmental nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4745 LDT-PCG-CS Gata3 Lhx1 Gaba_4 (CS20230722_SUPT_1059, CS20230722_CLUS_4745)." []
