def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Olig3 (Mmus), Hpse (Mmus), Npsr1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PDTg Otp Olig3 Gaba cells by expression of Hpse, Npsr1. It is GABAergic. These cells are are located in the Pons, in or close to the regions: Pontine central gray. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4762 PDTg Otp Olig3 Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_4762)." []
comment: Warning: This type PDTg Otp Olig3 Gaba_1 Hpse does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for posterodorsal tegmental nucleus (PDTg). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
