def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ikzf1 (Mmus), Tfap2b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MY Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_5 cells by expression of Ikzf1, Hoxb5. It is GABAergic and glycinergic. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4920 MY Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_5 (CS20230722_CLUS_4920)." []
comment: Warning: This type MY Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_5 Ikzf1 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for medulla (MY). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
