[Term]
id: PCL:0117334
name: MDRN Hoxb5 Ebf2 Gly-Gaba_1 Fbln7 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Hoxc6 (Mmus), Aqp6 (Mmus), Chodl (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MDRN Hoxb5 Ebf2 Gly-Gaba cells by expression of Fbln7. It is GABAergic and glycinergic. These cells are are located in the Medulla, in or close to the regions: Medulla, Nucleus of the solitary tract, Cuneate nucleus. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:4954 MDRN Hoxb5 Ebf2 Gly-Gaba_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_4954)." []
