def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Apela (Mmus), Hoxb5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_5 cells by expression of Apela. It is GABAergic and glycinergic. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5053 PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_5 (CS20230722_CLUS_5053)." []
comment: Warning: This type PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_5 Apela does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for parvicellular reticular nucleus (PARN), medullary reticular nucleus, dorsal part (MDRNd), nucleus of the solitary tract (NTS). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "5053 PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_5" EXACT []
synonym: "Apela (Mmus), Hoxb5 (Mmus) expressing neuron of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
