comment: Warning: This type NTS-PARN Neurod2 Gly-Gaba_3 C1ql1 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for nucleus of the solitary tract (NTS), parvicellular reticular nucleus (PARN). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
