name: CHOR NN_1 Slc17a8 choroid plexus epithelial cell (Mmus)
def: "A choroid plexus epithelial cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 2900040C04Rik (Mmus), Slc17a8 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CHOR NN cells by expression of Slc17a8. It is glutamatergic. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5265 CHOR NN_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_5265)." []
synonym: "2900040C04Rik (Mmus), Slc17a8 (Mmus) expressing choroid plexus epithelial cell of brain (Mus musculus)" EXACT []
