[Term]
id: PCL:0117647
name: OPC NN_1 Irx2 oligodendrocyte precursor cell (Mmus)
def: "A oligodendrocyte precursor cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pdgfra (Mmus), Pclaf (Mmus), Irx2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other OPC NN_1 cells by expression of Neil3, Irx2. These cells are are located in the Midbrain, Medulla, Cerebellum, Pons, in or close to the regions: Pons. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5267 OPC NN_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_5267)." []
