[Term]
id: PCL:0117648
name: OPC NN_1 Mms22l oligodendrocyte precursor cell (Mmus)
def: "A oligodendrocyte precursor cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pdgfra (Mmus), Olig1 (Mmus), Mms22l (Mmus), Top2a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other OPC NN_1 cells by expression of Mms22l, Foxg1, Top2a. These cells are are located in the Isocortex, Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate, in or close to the regions: Caudoputamen, Piriform area. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5268 OPC NN_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_5268)." []
