[Term]
id: PCL:0117681
name: VLMC NN_2 Srpx2 vascular leptomeningeal cell (Mmus)
def: "A vascular leptomeningeal cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igf2 (Mmus), Srpx2 (Mmus), Tln2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VLMC NN_2 cells by expression of Srpx2, Slc7a11, Tln2. These cells are are located in the Hippocampal region, Cerebellum, Olfactory areas, Midbrain, Isocortex, Medulla, Striatum dorsal region, Thalamus, in or close to the regions: Caudoputamen. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5301 VLMC NN_2 (CS20230722_CLUS_5301)." []
synonym: "5301 VLMC NN_2" EXACT []
