[Term]
id: PCL:0117682
name: VLMC NN_3 vascular leptomeningeal cell (Mmus)
def: "A vascular leptomeningeal cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cfh (Mmus), Dpep1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VLMC NN cells by expression of Alpl. These cells are are located in the Cerebellum, in or close to the regions: choroid plexus, third ventricle, fimbria, lateral ventricle. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5302 VLMC NN_3 (CS20230722_SUPT_1189, CS20230722_CLUS_5302)." []
