[Term]
id: PCL:0117690
name: Endo NN_1 Slco1a4 endothelial cell (Mmus)
def: "A endothelial cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slco1a4 (Mmus), Adgrl4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Endo NN cells by expression of Slco1a4, Adgrl4. These cells are are located in the Cerebellum, Olfactory areas, Striatum dorsal region, Midbrain, Isocortex, Pons, Medulla, in or close to the regions: Caudoputamen. Standard transcriptomic reference data for this class can be found at https://purl.brain-bican.org/taxonomy/CCN20230722 in cluster:5310 Endo NN_1 (CS20230722_CLUS_5310)." []
